        <para>A7(C) <u>determine the effects on the graph of the parent function \(\underline{f(x) = x^2}\) </u>when \(f(x)\) is replaced by <u>\(\underline{af(x), f(x) + d, f(x - c)}\),</u> \(f(bx)\) for specific values of \(a\), \(b\), \(c\), and \(d\)</para>
